{"id": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java::22::0", "file": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java", "module": "spring-jdbc", "block_start": 22, "start": 23, "end": 23, "indent": "", "lines": ["Batch update callback interface used by the {@link JdbcTemplate} class."]}
{"id": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java::22::1", "file": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java", "module": "spring-jdbc", "block_start": 22, "start": 25, "end": 28, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p>This interface sets values on a {@link java.sql.PreparedStatement} provided", "by the JdbcTemplate class, for each of a number of updates in a batch using the", "same SQL. Implementations are responsible for setting any necessary parameters.", "SQL with placeholders will already have been supplied."]}
{"id": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java::22::2", "file": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java", "module": "spring-jdbc", "block_start": 22, "start": 30, "end": 32, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p>Implementations <i>do not</i> need to concern themselves with SQLExceptions", "that may be thrown from operations they attempt. The JdbcTemplate class will", "catch and handle SQLExceptions appropriately."]}
{"id": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java::41::0", "file": "spring-jdbc/src/main/java/org/springframework/jdbc/core/BatchPreparedStatementSetter.java", "module": "spring-jdbc", "block_start": 41, "start": 42, "end": 42, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Set parameter values on the given PreparedStatement."]}
